{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "The Next Step", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "The Website", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 6, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 15, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.3", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "  Describe the reasons or results of events or actions in spoken or written texts, in work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn11le15ob06re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Review: Simple Present, Present Continuous, Simple Future", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " Let's review the uses of each of these verb tenses. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use the <span class=\"underline\">Simple Present Tense</span>:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "1. To talk about something that is true in the present<br/>Example: <span class=\"italic\">The group <span class=\"strong\">consists </span> of both old and new employees.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "2. To talk about something that is repeated (routines)<br/>Example: <span class=\"italic\">I  <span class=\"strong\">get up </span>at 5:00 every morning.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "3. To talk about something that is always true (fact)<br/>Example: <span class=\"italic\">Water<span class=\"strong\"> contains</span> oxygen and hydrogen.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "4. To talk about schedules in the future <br/>Example:<span class=\"italic\">The bus <span class=\"strong\">leaves </span>at  7:00 this evening.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the <span class=\"underline\">Present Continuous Tense</span>:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "1. To talk about something that is happening at the moment of speaking<br/>Example: <span class=\"italic\">I <span class=\"strong\">am trying</span> to understand when I have to use present continuous.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "2. To talk about something which is happening at a specific time<br/>Example: <span class=\"italic\"> At 7:00 tonight, I <span class=\"strong\">am playing</span> guitar at the local bar.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "3. To talk about temporary events <br/>Example: <span class=\"italic\">I am at the conservatory. I <span class=\"strong\">am studying </span>music.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "4. To talk about changes, developments and trends<br/> Example: <span class=\"italic\">The growing number of clients<span class=\"strong\"> is putting</span>  a strain on our resources.</span> ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "5. To emphasize that something is done repeatedly <br><br/>Example: <br><span class=\"italic\">They<span class=\"strong\">'re always having</span> friends over on Friday nights.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the <span class=\"underline\">Simple Future</span> (will) to:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "1. To predict something will happen in the future<br/>Example:<span class=\"italic\"> I imagine the boardroom <span class=\"strong\">will </span> be full for the meeting.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "2. To make a decision in the moment of speaking<br/>Example: <span class=\"italic\">Okay, I<span class=\"strong\">'ll </span>start the meeting.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I don't know how to make a website so I'm interested to see how you did it.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "People are adding resources all the time.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I'll go through the steps with you.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "There are already 150 million domain names out there.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I'm working on linking pages for the author bio and some social media safety information.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I think it will look great when it's all done. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " How to Create a Website", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " Having a professional-looking website could be crucial to your business. What are the steps to creating a website?", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<ol><li> Choose the website building platform that you will use for your site. </li><li> Select a domain name and a hosting to represent the book and publisher.</li> <li> Design a theme or a template and start adding your content, like images or text.</li><li> Customize the templates any way you want so that they reflect what you want to communicate to your viewers. </li><li> Add pages and link them to your navigation bar so you can group types of information. </li><li> Edit your page titles and taglines so that people searching for your site can easily find it.</li></ol>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "perplexing", "type": "name"}, {"content": "confusing and uncertain", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It sounds perplexing already.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le15ob06aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about work and building a website.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "user-friendly", "type": "name"}, {"content": "easy to use and understand", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: New content management systems like Word Press are very user-friendly. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le15ob06aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "domain name", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the \u200bpart of an \u200bemail or \u200bwebsite \u200baddress giving the \u200bname of the \u200borganization the \u200baddress \u200bbelongs to", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The next I thing I did was to choose a domain name and a hosting to represent the book and publisher.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le15ob06aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "per", "type": "name"}, {"content": "for each", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: On Word Press these cost about $4 per month. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le15ob06aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "brandable", "type": "name"}, {"content": "unique; able to be marketed ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You need to think up a brandable and catchy domain name.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le15ob06aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "catchy", "type": "name"}, {"content": "instantly appealing and memorable", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: A catchy slogan is one that sticks in your mind.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le15ob06aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to customize", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to modify something to suit a particular individual or task", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You can customize the templates any way you want so that they reflect what you want to communicate to your viewers.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le15ob06aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Surf the Internet and look at different types of websites.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you find one that appeals to you, look at it in more detail.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make notes about what you like about the website.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "If there is anything that you would change, make a note of it.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a paragraph describing the website and why you think it is good.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your paragraph to your class or group.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I surf 